## COMMON MISTAKES TO AVOID
❌ Computing before analyzing (you might compute the wrong thing)
❌ Forgetting the metric (sum vs mean are very different)
❌ Mixing up FISCAL and CALENDAR years
❌ Doing mental math (always use python3 -c)
❌ Extracting from wrong column/row
❌ Forgetting to write FINAL_ANSWER to /app/answer.txt
❌ Including units in the answer (just the number)

